349
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:18,000
And corporate America has begun to answer the threat

350
00:19:18,001 --> 00:19:20,040
serious injury and material damage,

351
00:19:20,140 --> 00:19:23,300
with a newly developed arsenal of bomb detection equipment

352
00:19:23,400 --> 00:19:25,400
