390
00:21:10,941 --> 00:21:13,480
and compared to the known signatures of explosives

391
00:21:13,580 --> 00:21:16,880
like TNT, C4, and nitroglycerin.

392
00:21:20,280 --> 00:21:23,080
Within 14 seconds, the results are in.

393
00:21:23,180 --> 00:21:25,080
This is a nitro alarm.

394
00:21:25,180 --> 00:21:27,520
And the screen view that you're looking at right now

395
00:21:27,620 --> 00:21:28,920
