396
00:21:29,020 --> 00:21:31,860
On our y-axis here, we have the relative strength

397
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:32,760
of the alarm.

398
00:21:32,860 --> 00:21:36,540
And on the x-axis, we have the time of flight of the molecule.

399
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:39,400
Smaller, portable versions of the new ion trackers

400
00:21:39,401 --> 00:21:42,700
can put this anti-terror technology virtually anywhere

401
00:21:42,800 --> 00:21:45,340
a terrorist might conceal explosives.

402
00:21:45,440 --> 00:21:48,140
What we've got here is GE Eintracht's itemizer.

403
00:21:48,240 --> 00:21:50,540
And how it's used is we basically

404
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:54,040
acquire a sample by taking a sample trap, which is what

