00:21:55,840 --> 00:22:02,560
We'll wipe surfaces down and take it off the wand,

407
00:22:02,660 --> 00:22:07,000
introduce it into the machine, where it takes an analysis

408
00:22:07,001 --> 00:22:08,240
typically in about 10 seconds.

409
00:22:11,840 --> 00:22:14,240
It's an updated version of the bomb-sniffing equipment

410
00:22:14,340 --> 00:22:17,340
