411
00:22:17,440 --> 00:22:20,240
to detect traces of explosives on luggage,

412
00:22:20,340 --> 00:22:23,980
evidence that the traveler has been in contact with a bomb.

413
00:22:24,080 --> 00:22:26,860
To give you an idea of the sensitivity of the equipment,

414
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:31,860
what I've got here is one very small grain of TNT.

415
00:22:31,960 --> 00:22:35,860
And if I just place that in my hands,

416
00:22:35,861 --> 00:22:42,100
Take a sample, introduce it into the machine,

417
00:22:42,200 --> 00:22:44,940
remove the sample.

418
00:22:45,040 --> 00:22:47,680
That's a pretty large hit.

419
00:22:47,780 --> 00:22:49,580
But machines like this wouldn't

420
00:22:49,680 --> 00:22:53,240
be able to tell TNT from table salt if it weren't

421
00:22:53,340 --> 00:22:54,540
for machines like this.

422
00:22:54,541 --> 00:23:07,020
This is the 10-kilogram spherical chamber

423
00:23:07,120 --> 00:23:09,760
at the Department of Energy's Lawrence Livermore Labs.

424
00:23:14,520 --> 00:23:17,260
Scientists in the Energetic Materials Lab here

425
00:23:17,360 --> 00:23:20,940
use it to study explosions, like those made by plastic

426
00:23:21,040 --> 00:23:24,540
explosives, TNT, and fertilizer bombs.

427
00:23:24,541 --> 00:23:30,580
What they learn is how to make substances that look like high

428
00:23:30,680 --> 00:23:34,580
explosives, smell like high explosives, even x-ray like the

429
00:23:34,680 --> 00:23:37,880
real thing, but won't even burn.

430
00:23:37,980 --> 00:23:41,960
Called explosive simulants, these bogus bombs are used to train

431
00:23:42,060 --> 00:23:45,920
bomb-sniffing dogs and calibrate detection equipment without the

432
00:23:46,020 --> 00:23:48,400
