433
00:23:48,500 --> 00:23:51,560
This is an example of Semtex right here.

434
00:23:51,561 --> 00:23:54,060
This is an explosive that was originally developed

435
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:55,400
in Eastern Europe.

436
00:23:55,500 --> 00:23:57,300
This is an actual simulant.

437
00:23:57,400 --> 00:23:59,440
It looks like the real explosive.

438
00:23:59,540 --> 00:24:01,100
It smells like the real explosives.

439
00:24:01,200 --> 00:24:03,500
It can be picked up on the detection equipment that

440
00:24:03,600 --> 00:24:05,700
