443
00:24:10,940 --> 00:24:14,320
there are still ways that a terrorist can evade the security

444
00:24:14,420 --> 00:24:17,320
intended to thwart a bombing.

445
00:24:17,420 --> 00:24:20,280
Even in the best protected area, one vulnerable feature

446
00:24:20,281 --> 00:24:23,760
