463
00:25:17,581 --> 00:25:20,420
In this case, the threat would have been neutralized.

464
00:25:20,520 --> 00:25:23,180
But the fallout from a so-called dirty bomb

465
00:25:23,280 --> 00:25:26,820
or a biological release would pose another kind of threat.

466
00:25:29,920 --> 00:25:33,760
Such challenges have prompted a new breed of dream machines

467
00:25:33,860 --> 00:25:36,140
designed to detect invisible threats

468
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:38,040
