469
00:25:38,041 --> 00:25:50,760
They are the unseen tools of terror, anthrax spores,

470
00:25:50,860 --> 00:25:55,420
smallpox virus, botulism bacteria, bubonic plague.

471
00:25:55,520 --> 00:25:57,320
These are the organisms or the agents

472
00:25:57,420 --> 00:25:59,300
that are of greatest concern.

473
00:25:59,400 --> 00:26:02,500
There is good reason to believe that they could potentially

474
00:26:02,600 --> 00:26:08,040
be used as agents in a biological warfare attack.

475
00:26:08,041 --> 00:26:09,740
Although the US and other countries

476
00:26:09,840 --> 00:26:13,680
developed biological weapons during and after World War II,

477
00:26:13,780 --> 00:26:19,180
the programs were outlawed under international law in 1972.

478
00:26:19,280 --> 00:26:21,980
Still, experts in counterterrorism

479
00:26:22,080 --> 00:26:24,920
have warned that a terrorist attack with biological agents

480
00:26:25,020 --> 00:26:28,400
against corporate targets is not a question of if, but when.

481
00:26:33,300 --> 00:26:35,900
As recent events have proved, when is now.

482
00:26:38,040 --> 00:26:40,040
October 2001.

483
00:26:40,140 --> 00:26:42,040
The offices of tabloid newspaper

484
00:26:42,140 --> 00:26:45,040
The National Enquirer are mysteriously contaminated

485
00:26:45,140 --> 00:26:46,540
with anthrax.

486
00:26:46,640 --> 00:26:48,680
A 63-year-old picture editor dies

487
00:26:48,780 --> 00:26:50,780
after being contaminated.

488
00:26:50,880 --> 00:26:55,700
Investigators suggest the event is the work of bioterrorists.

489
00:26:55,800 --> 00:26:58,700
Corporations across America have since begun adopting

490
00:26:58,800 --> 00:27:01,400
mail-handling sanitation machinery,

491
00:27:01,500 --> 00:27:04,440
like the Mail Shelter, to guard against the possibility

492
00:27:04,540 --> 00:27:08,040
of more anthrax attacks through the mail.

493
00:27:08,041 --> 00:27:10,340
The mail shelter allows workers to open envelopes

494
00:27:10,440 --> 00:27:13,040
in a pressurized chamber that draws contaminants

495
00:27:13,140 --> 00:27:18,380
into an air filter before they can contaminate the mail room.

496
00:27:18,480 --> 00:27:23,020
The example of what happened in the fall of 2001

497
00:27:23,120 --> 00:27:25,120
really brought home the fact that we

498
00:27:25,220 --> 00:27:29,560
need to be ready to respond in a rapid fashion

499
00:27:29,660 --> 00:27:31,760
to be able to decontaminate and restore buildings

500
00:27:31,860 --> 00:27:34,340
and infrastructure that has been subjected

501
00:27:34,440 --> 00:27:36,340
to some kind of intentional release

502
00:27:36,341 --> 00:27:40,180
of a microbiological organism.

503
00:27:40,280 --> 00:27:43,380
The first step at avoiding the effects of bioterrorism

504
00:27:43,480 --> 00:27:44,980
is prevention.

505
00:27:45,080 --> 00:27:47,080
At the Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory,

506
00:27:47,180 --> 00:27:49,880
progress is being made at perfecting a sort of smoke

507
00:27:49,980 --> 00:27:53,100
detector for deadly pathogens.

508
00:27:53,200 --> 00:27:56,800
The APDS, the Autonomous Pathogen Detection System,

509
00:27:56,900 --> 00:28:01,540
is a system that's designed to continuously monitor the air

510
00:28:01,640 --> 00:28:06,100
for the presence of airborne biological threat agents.

511
00:28:06,101 --> 00:28:11,900
Things like anthrax or the organism that causes plague.

512
00:28:12,000 --> 00:28:14,140
Identifying a sample once took scientists

513
00:28:14,240 --> 00:28:16,580
hours in a laboratory, precious time

514
00:28:16,680 --> 00:28:20,280
before an act of bioterrorism could be detected.

515
00:28:20,380 --> 00:28:23,320
The sample must arrive from the location where contamination

516
00:28:23,420 --> 00:28:24,480
is suspected.

517
00:28:24,580 --> 00:28:26,760
Then technicians run complex procedures

518
00:28:26,860 --> 00:28:30,160
like antibody identification and DNA analysis

519
00:28:30,260 --> 00:28:32,660
to get their answer.

520
00:28:32,760 --> 00:28:35,300
Because diseases like smallpox and anthrax

521
00:28:35,301 --> 00:28:38,100
can be cured if there is sufficient warning,

522
00:28:38,200 --> 00:28:41,200
detection time is crucial.

523
00:28:41,300 --> 00:28:45,680
This is the Autonomous Pathogen Detector, or APDS.

524
00:28:45,780 --> 00:28:49,180
It will run 24 hours a day without help from people

525
00:28:49,280 --> 00:28:52,860
to duplicate the same complex tests once done in the lab,

526
00:28:52,960 --> 00:28:55,780
constantly searching for the unique signatures of killer

527
00:28:55,880 --> 00:28:58,820
germs in the air.

528
00:28:58,920 --> 00:29:02,220
The device samples the air, filters out smoke and dust,

529
00:29:02,320 --> 00:29:04,500
and mixes what remains with lab fluids

530
00:29:04,501 --> 00:29:08,840
to extract the DNA of any pathogen it collects.

531
00:29:08,940 --> 00:29:10,900
The system relies on gene chips, which

532
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:13,740
are imprinted with the DNA information of anthrax,

533
00:29:13,840 --> 00:29:17,240
smallpox, and other deadly microbes.

534
00:29:17,340 --> 00:29:21,480
If the DNA from an air sample matches the DNA on the chip,

535
00:29:21,580 --> 00:29:26,020
this is evidence of a biological release.

536
00:29:26,120 --> 00:29:29,460
The aerosol collector takes in air continuously.

537
00:29:29,560 --> 00:29:33,700
It screens out large particles, things like pollen, which are

538
00:29:33,701 --> 00:29:37,400
which are quite big relative to the size of the particles

539
00:29:37,500 --> 00:29:39,940
we're actually interested in.

540
00:29:40,040 --> 00:29:44,480
The smaller particles then are concentrated into a fluid.

541
00:29:44,580 --> 00:29:47,120
And the fluid is contained here in this,

542
00:29:47,220 --> 00:29:50,020
this is called a cyclone.

543
00:29:50,120 --> 00:29:52,260
Next, the solution from the cyclone

544
00:29:52,360 --> 00:29:55,260
is pumped into an automated sample reservoir

545
00:29:55,360 --> 00:29:57,860
to await a barrage of tests.

546
00:29:57,960 --> 00:30:01,560
That's the sole of the APDS.

547
00:30:01,561 --> 00:30:04,960
It's a multiplex detection system.

548
00:30:05,060 --> 00:30:06,360
See the probe here?

549
00:30:06,460 --> 00:30:08,760
It goes down and aspirates into that sample cup,

550
00:30:08,860 --> 00:30:11,300
pulls up a sample, and then analyzes that

551
00:30:11,400 --> 00:30:13,800
for a total of 60 seconds.

552
00:30:13,900 --> 00:30:16,800
You're looking now at the fluidics module.

553
00:30:16,900 --> 00:30:19,480
This is the module that allows us to conduct

554
00:30:19,580 --> 00:30:23,020
an automated immunoassay.

555
00:30:23,120 --> 00:30:24,720
A handheld version of this machine,

556
00:30:24,820 --> 00:30:29,280
called HANA, for Handheld Advanced Nucleic Acid Analyzer,

557
00:30:29,281 --> 00:30:32,220
is designed to be used by emergency response teams

558
00:30:32,320 --> 00:30:35,780
when an event of bioterrorism is suspected.

559
00:30:35,880 --> 00:30:39,820
All the responder has to do is introduce the sample,

560
00:30:39,920 --> 00:30:43,320
set in the appropriate program to begin this operation

561
00:30:43,420 --> 00:30:47,040
in this chamber or whichever chamber is appropriate,

562
00:30:47,140 --> 00:30:49,560
and then wait 20 minutes for a response.

563
00:30:49,660 --> 00:30:51,400
A response is a signal.

564
00:30:51,500 --> 00:30:53,840
You'll get an amplification of a signal here

565
00:30:53,940 --> 00:30:58,000
to tell you if the agent that you're looking for in your assay

566
00:30:58,001 --> 00:31:01,940
is present or not.

567
00:31:02,040 --> 00:31:05,040
But as the threat of biological attack persists,

568
00:31:05,140 --> 00:31:07,380
there is another equally disturbing threat

569
00:31:07,480 --> 00:31:09,120
that researchers at the Livermore Labs

570
00:31:09,220 --> 00:31:12,840
must also address, the possibility of radiological

571
00:31:12,940 --> 00:31:17,720
terror attack with a dirty bomb.

572
00:31:17,820 --> 00:31:20,920
A dirty bomb is a conventional explosive like dynamite

573
00:31:21,020 --> 00:31:23,720
that has been packaged with radioactive material that

574
00:31:23,820 --> 00:31:26,220
