652
00:34:53,420 --> 00:34:56,360
The force of the truck bomb rips away the entire north side

653
00:34:56,361 --> 00:34:58,160
of the Alfred P. Murrah Federal Building,

654
00:34:58,860 --> 00:35:03,160
