665
00:35:34,540 --> 00:35:39,020
And when the glass is taken out, then the other things

666
00:35:39,120 --> 00:35:43,080
in the immediate area also become missiles.

667
00:35:43,081 --> 00:35:47,080
These windows address actually three types of threats,

668
00:35:47,180 --> 00:35:53,920
and this is blast, bio, and chemo warfare materials.

669
00:35:54,020 --> 00:35:56,820
At their development site in Arlington, Virginia,

670
00:35:56,920 --> 00:35:59,760
a team of glass manufacturers have joined forces

671
00:35:59,860 --> 00:36:01,600
to produce the first window designed

672
00:36:01,700 --> 00:36:04,540
