00:37:54,521 --> 00:37:57,520
In the Oklahoma City bombing,

706
00:37:57,521 --> 00:38:01,520
Timothy McVeigh is believed to have used a 5,000-pound ammonium nitrate,

707
00:38:01,521 --> 00:38:04,320
ammonium nitrate, or fertilizer bomb,

708
00:38:04,321 --> 00:38:07,520
parked outside in his rented truck.

709
00:38:07,521 --> 00:38:13,060
And we have windows that can give the right protection

710
00:38:13,061 --> 00:38:17,200
against this type of terror threat.

711
00:38:17,201 --> 00:38:19,140
To develop bomb-resistant windows

712
00:38:19,141 --> 00:38:21,140
that might protect a high-rise building

713
00:38:21,141 --> 00:38:23,840
from another Oklahoma City-type attack,

714
00:38:23,841 --> 00:38:27,280
test window number 1006 was subjected to a blast

