I just basically ran.

788
00:42:23,820 --> 00:42:28,160
And when I touched down, it was very easy, very comfortable.

789
00:42:29,380 --> 00:42:32,860
But while most anti-terror tech gives warning

790
00:42:32,861 --> 00:42:40,760
or provides defense from imminent attack,

791
00:42:41,000 --> 00:42:45,600
the $1,500 evacu-shoot is strictly a desperate measure

792
00:42:45,601 --> 00:42:50,000
to be used only when no other choice exists.

793
00:42:50,100 --> 00:42:51,800
Opponents argue that the evacu-shoot

794
00:42:51,900 --> 00:42:54,840
may provide a false sense of security in the high rise,

795
00:42:54,940 --> 00:42:56,540
or that victims might choose to use it

796
00:42:56,640 --> 00:42:59,840
before conventional rescue methods have been exhausted,

797
00:42:59,940 --> 00:43:02,460
only adding to the risk.

798
00:43:02,560 --> 00:43:05,460
I completely understand that leaping from a high rise

799
00:43:05,560 --> 00:43:10,460
building goes against just about anybody's perspective

800
00:43:10,560 --> 00:43:12,160
of what's natural.

801
00:43:12,260 --> 00:43:15,360
However, when people get informed and become educated

802
00:43:15,361 --> 00:43:19,900
of the realities of high-rise fires and evacuation.

803
00:43:20,000 --> 00:43:23,900
Systems such as the evacu-shoot will become common sense.

804
00:43:24,000 --> 00:43:26,700
How will the corporate world cope with the likelihood

805
00:43:26,800 --> 00:43:28,700
that there will be more terrorist attacks

806
00:43:28,800 --> 00:43:32,520
against soft targets like high-rise buildings?

807
00:43:32,620 --> 00:43:34,820
The answer is taking shape in the laboratories

808
00:43:34,920 --> 00:43:37,320
and testing centers across America,

809
00:43:37,420 --> 00:43:40,620
on the leading edge of anti-terror technology.

810
00:43:40,720 --> 00:43:43,720
If an organization or an individual knows,

811
00:43:43,721 --> 00:43:46,220
we're going to be able to respond quickly

812
00:43:46,320 --> 00:43:48,220
with minimal infrastructure damage,

813
00:43:48,320 --> 00:43:52,520
minimal economic damage, and ideally minimal human damage,

814
00:43:52,620 --> 00:43:56,360
then there's no real reason to have a release or an event at

815
00:43:56,460 --> 00:43:57,260
all.

816
00:43:57,360 --> 00:43:59,160
It loses all of its impact.

817
00:43:59,260 --> 00:44:02,880
Their work may never erase terrorism completely.

818
00:44:02,980 --> 00:44:07,480
But together, they will bring us closer to a common goal,

819
00:44:07,580 --> 00:44:09,420
the goal of being prepared.

